  "description": "基于AScript扩展的Lua脚本语言，支持Lua基础语法及数据类型；\n快速开始：\n// 注册lua脚本语言\nScript.Langs.Set(\"lua\", LuaLang.Instance);\n// 执行lua脚本\nstring s = @\"\nfunction sum(a, b)\n    return a + b\nend\nlocal n = 10\nsum(n, 5)\n\";\nvar script = new Script();\nscript.Context.Langs = new[] { \"lua\" };\nvar result = script.Eval(s);\nAssert.AreEqual(15L, result);",
